    <summary>Professional authentication profile management system for Claude Code CLI on Windows with enterprise-grade security and PowerShell integration.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
# Claude Profile Manager for Windows

A robust authentication profile management system for Claude Code CLI that allows seamless switching between different Claude authentication methods on Windows systems.

## Key Features

### Profile Management
- **Save & Switch Profiles**: Save current Claude credentials as named profiles and switch between them instantly
- **Secure Storage**: All credentials stored using Windows Credential Manager with enterprise-grade encryption
- **Profile Health Monitoring**: Real-time token expiration detection and health validation
- **Alias Support**: Create convenient shortcuts for frequently used profiles

### Enterprise Security
- **Windows ACL Integration**: File-level security with restrictive permissions
- **Memory Protection**: SecureString-based credential handling with automatic cleanup
- **Input Validation**: Comprehensive protection against injection attacks and path traversal
- **Audit Logging**: Optional detailed logging for compliance and troubleshooting

### PowerShell Integration
- **Native PowerShell Module**: Complete PowerShell cmdlet suite with rich object formatting
- **Pipeline Support**: Full PowerShell pipeline integration for advanced automation
- **Tab Completion**: IntelliSense support for all cmdlets and parameters
- **Help Documentation**: Comprehensive help system with examples and best practices

### Installation & Management
- **Automated Installation**: One-click installation with proper Windows integration
- **System Integration**: PATH environment variable management and shell integration
- **Health Diagnostics**: Comprehensive system health checks and troubleshooting tools
- **Unattended Operation**: Silent installation support for enterprise deployment

## System Requirements

- Windows 10 or Windows 11 (x64)
- .NET 9 Runtime
- PowerShell 5.1 or PowerShell Core 6+
- Claude Code CLI (automatically detected)

## Quick Start

After installation, use these commands to get started:

```powershell
# Import the PowerShell module
Import-Module ClaudeProfileManager

# Save your current credentials as a profile
Save-ClaudeProfile -Name "work" -Aliases "w", "office"

# List all profiles
Get-ClaudeProfile

# Switch between profiles
Switch-ClaudeProfile -Name "work"

# Check system health
Test-ClaudeProfileHealth
```

Or use the command-line interface directly:

```cmd
claude-profile-manager save work
claude-profile-manager list
claude-profile-manager switch work
claude-profile-manager current
```

## Enterprise Features

- **Group Policy Support**: Centralized configuration management
- **Active Directory Integration**: User and computer-based profile management
- **Compliance Reporting**: Detailed audit trails and compliance reports
- **Automated Deployment**: MSI installer with silent installation options
- **Security Hardening**: Advanced security configuration options

## Support

- **Documentation**: Comprehensive wiki with examples and troubleshooting guides
- **Community Support**: GitHub discussions and issue tracking
- **Enterprise Support**: Professional support options available

This package installs both the CLI application and PowerShell module for complete Windows integration.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes><![CDATA[
## Version 1.0.0 - Initial Release

### New Features
- Complete profile management system with save, switch, list, and delete operations
- Windows Credential Manager integration for secure credential storage
- PowerShell module with 10+ cmdlets for native Windows integration
- Comprehensive health monitoring and diagnostics
- Alias support for convenient profile access
- Enterprise-grade security with Windows ACL integration
- Automated installation and deployment tools

### Security Enhancements
- SecureString-based credential handling with automatic memory cleanup
- Windows ACL file protection with restrictive permissions
- Input validation and injection attack prevention
- Comprehensive error sanitization and information leakage protection

### PowerShell Integration
- Native PowerShell cmdlets with rich object formatting
- Full pipeline support and tab completion
- Comprehensive help documentation with examples
- Custom validation attributes and parameter validation

### Enterprise Features
- Silent installation support for automated deployment
- System-wide PATH integration and shell configuration
- Comprehensive logging and audit capabilities
- Health monitoring with detailed diagnostic information

### Installation & Deployment
- Chocolatey package for easy installation and updates
- Professional MSI installer for enterprise deployment
- Automated uninstallation with data preservation options
- Cross-platform PowerShell compatibility (5.1+ and Core)

### Testing & Quality
- 138+ comprehensive test cases with full coverage
- Security validation and penetration testing
- Performance optimization and memory leak prevention
- Compatibility testing across Windows versions
]]></releaseNotes>
